  "question": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math> are the emf of the following three galvanic cells respectively</p>(i) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Zn</mi><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mfenced><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>Zn</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>Cu</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mi>Cu</mi><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mfenced></math><p>(ii) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Zn</mi><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mfenced><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>Zn</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>Cu</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mi>Cu</mi><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>(iii) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Zn</mi><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mfenced><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>Zn</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>Cu</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mi>Cu</mi><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>Which of the following is true?</p>"
  },
